# remotix — the identity of the network side (DECISIONS.md §11.50).
# The service starts as root (the ROOT side: PAM, the desktops' birth); the process
# that faces the network — TLS, QUIC, the page, the ban table — drops to this user
# before it reads a single byte from a client.  No groups: it never opens a card.
# ⛔ The SAME line in packaging/{debian,rpm,arch}/remotix.sysusers
#    (packaging/arch/build.sh checks they are byte-identical).
u remotix - "REMOTIX network side" / /usr/sbin/nologin
